      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow1:021",
        "answer": "Creates Healing/Wounded/Buffed/Critical/Normal portrait images, each updated from nonnil CharacterSelection.characterIndex through its exact source image conversion. Health healthValue/maxHealth/maxHealthRegen and playerGadget1.state changes request state reevaluation. Critical, Wounded, Buffed and Healing predicates delegate to their specific HUD helpers. Registers close, optional postload, then SetupCharacterPortrait(self,controller), returns self. These are portrait/model consumers, not health/damage reconstruction.",
